id: pm-eq4x
title: Fold lifecycle sugar start-task/pause-task/close-task into claim/release/close flags (hidden aliases)
description: "start-task = pm claim --start (claim + in_progress), pause-task = pm release --pause (open + release claim), close-task = pm close --release-assignment; the three -task commands become alias-table entries. Duplicate check: pm-114v (claim --next) and pm-8t5x (claim atomicity) are claim semantics, not surface; no overlap."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:lifecycle",simplification
