acceptance_criteria: claim/release/close gain the equivalent flags; start-task/pause-task/close-task alias-shimmed with identical output incl. status transitions and claim records; contracts/MCP/completions/docs regenerated; lifecycle-transition specs pass via aliases
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Added canonical claim --start, release --pause and close --release-assignment backed by shared typed SDK primitives, preserving legacy aliases, custom statuses, evidence and MCP literal input."
expected_result: "Canonical and legacy commands preserve ownership and lifecycle semantics, expose accurate typed receipts and stay within strict quality budgets."
actual_result: "657 files and 8656 tests passed with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; linked tests, 100 percent docstrings, static/type/grammar/token/performance gates and npm/Bun package acceptance passed."
